text:
For a Lifetime facility this is the worst one I've attended. Poor weight room housecleaning, machines too close together & surprisingly this place is ALWAYS busy.   

Update due to Brittany's reply;

Please let the manager know about often times there are no clean towels upstairs, you allow a weight lifter to bring his own bag of chalk,  the dumbells are always out of place and spreadout over the floor, the shower area often is out of large towels, and you have a personal trainer that likes to solicit on the floor.
